// Rating component - accessible radio group rendered as a row of icons (stars, hearts, thumbs) or number chips.
// Submitted/stored value is a plain number (1..maxValue). No half-steps by design (issue #158).
[fmdbext:rating] > jnt:content, fmdbmix:element, fmdbmix:validationMessages
 - helpText (string, richtext[ckeditor.toolbar='FormidableHelp',ckeditor.customConfig='$context/modules/formidable-engine/javascript/ckeditor/helpTextConfig.js']) i18n indexed=no
 - icon (string, choicelist[resourceBundle]) = 'star' autocreated indexed=no < 'star', 'heart', 'thumb', 'number'
 - maxValue (long) = 5 autocreated indexed=no
 - minLabel (string) i18n indexed=no
 - maxLabel (string) i18n indexed=no
 - required (boolean) = false
